ve Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nYour Trusted Partner for Emergency and Specialty Healthcare for Pets\nMedVet Akron serves as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced emergency and specialty pet care. You can count on our board-certified specialists and expert emergency team to provide the most comprehensive and compassionate care. More than 15,000 patients a year come through our doors, and our trusted team treats every pet as if they’re our own.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our team is here 24/7/365 to give compassionate care during critical times. You’ll also have access to board-certified specialists should your pet need advanced care.\nOur Surgery and Neurology teams offer flexible, select Saturday\nappointments for clients who prefer the ease of weekend scheduling.\nMedVet Akron Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiology\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nChiara Costanzo, DVM, PhD, MRCVS, BSAVA PGCertSAECC\nMedical Director\nAmanda Newhouse\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nJacqueline Bloch-Miles\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nKelly A. Bowman\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nIan Brooks\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nJason S. Callard\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal), CCRP, cVMA\nSurgery\nKacey  Cohen\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRoxanne Constanzo\n, VMD\nEmergency Medicine\nChiara Costanzo\n, DVM, PhD, MRCVS, BSAVA PGCertSAECC\nEmergency Medicine\nJohn M. Crandell\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nDaniel Davis\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nShane Dewitt\n, DVM, DACVIM (LAIM)\nEmergency Medicine\nMelissa B. Garr\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAdrianne Garrett\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlexandra Heritage\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMegan  Hoelter\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nWendy J. Kollar\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTom Kozlovich\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nKelsey Moffett\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKaitlin  Murphy\n,  VMD\nEmergency Medicine\nMichele Provencher\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nLaura A. Quinn\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMarianna Schafer\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nMeg Sislak\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nKyle Snowdon\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nSarah R. Stewart\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLogan Strohm\n, DVM, MS, DACVR\nRadiology\nCarrie E. Symmonds\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n26\n)\nPet Stories\n“We took Tiger to MedVet after she ingested glass. The first emergency vet I talked to wanted immediate surgery, but MedVet’s specialist was kind, thoughtful, and compassionate. He called multiple times daily, worked through options to avoid surgery, and was transparent with recommendations. It felt like he genuinely cared about helping us make right decisions during this scary time.”\n“This was our first emergency visit with Harley. Quick triage and registration, thorough assessment by the doctor. She recommended outpatient follow-up with our primary vet rather than the cost of emergency procedures. The staff was pleasant and professional, and emailed documents for quick departure. Highly recommended!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions 