      "address": "1321 Centerview Circle, Akron, OH 44321",
      "description": "Your Trusted Partner for Emergency and Specialty Healthcare for Pets  MedVet Akron serves as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced emergency and specialty pet care. You can count on our board-certified specialists and expert emergency team to provide the most comprehensive and compassionate care. More than 15,000 patients a year come through our doors, and our trusted team treats every pet as if they’re our own.   If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our team is here 24/7/365 to give compassionate care during critical times. You’ll also have access to board-certified specialists should your pet need advanced care. Our Surgery and Neurology teams offer flexible, select Saturday appointments for clients who prefer the ease of weekend scheduling.",
